0:{"buildId":"MXR_sKOuLMZ51XKuYTKZh","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","children":[["$","h1",null,{"data-count":"","children":"4. Impact of corn production on rural communities"}],[["$","p","0",{"className":"question","data-count":"","children":["What impacts does corn cultivation cause economically and socially within rural communities at a time when the province’s population is decreasing?"]}],["$","p","1",{"data-count":"","children":["Rural incomes have been on a steady upwards trend. Disposable income rose 5.8 percent in 2025 to 22,188 yuan per person ",["$","span","1",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","hlj25",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#hlj25","children":"HPBS 2026"}]]}]],")"]}],". Farms on the Northeast Plain average 12.8 hectares per person, compared to 2.7 on the North China Plain ",["$","span","3",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","huo",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#huo","children":"Huo et al. 2022"}]]}]],")"]}],", so a profit of about US$436 per hectare aligns with the given data."]}],["$","figure","2",{"className":"photo","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/photos/jiansheng-village.jpg","alt":"Aerial view of a small village of houses and gardens in a neat grid, surrounded on all sides by large green fields","width":1600,"height":1066,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":["Jiansheng, a small farming village on the Sanjiang Plain in eastern Heilongjiang, seen from a plane in August 2016."," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"credit","children":["Photo",": ","Ting Chen",","," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/","rel":"license","children":"CC BY-SA 2.0"}],", via"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BB%BA%E8%83%9C%E6%9D%91_August_2016_in_China.jpg","children":"Wikimedia Commons"}],"."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2","3",{"data-count":"","children":"China’s aging population"}],["$","p","4",{"data-count":"","children":["Heilongjiang lost 330,000 people in 2024 ",["$","span","1",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","caixin",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#caixin","children":"Caixin Global 2025"}]]}]],")"]}]," and 280,000 in 2025, and I calculated that its rural population fell by about 370,000 that year due to urbanisation (a rise from 68.05 to 68.98 percent according to ",["$","span","3",{"className":"cite","children":["",[["$","span","hlj24",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#hlj24","children":"HPBS (2025)"}]]}]],""]}]," and ",["$","span","5",{"className":"cite","children":["",[["$","span","hlj25",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#hlj25","children":"HPBS (2026)"}]]}]],""]}],") and people chasing opportunities in larger cities. More than half of the province’s primary schools have closed in a decade ",["$","span","7",{"className":"cite","children":["(",[["$","span","caixin",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#caixin","children":"Caixin Global 2025"}]]}]],")"]}],", this plays into a feedback loop where the younger population leaving the region causes a decrease in the government facilities needed by that younger population which in turn causes more young people to leave."]}],["$","figure","5",{"className":"photo photo-graph","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/graphs/china-urban-share-owid.png","alt":"Line graph of the share of China’s population living in urban areas from 1950 to 2025. It stays below 20 percent until about 1980, then rises steadily to about 66 percent in 2025.","width":1700,"height":1200,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":["Share of China’s population living in towns and cities, 1950 to 2025. It passed half in about 2011 and is now about two thirds. Data from the UN Population Division (2025)."," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"credit","children":["Graph",": ","Our World in Data",","," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","rel":"license","children":"CC BY 4.0"}],", via"," ","$L3","."]}]]}]]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9"],"$undefined"]}],"$La"],["$Lb"],"$Lc"]}],"isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lf","isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L11","isPartial":"$@12","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":"$13"},{"rsc":"$L14","isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@16","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@17"}
